6.627 5.373 12 12 12h301.941v46.059c0 21.382 25.851 32.09 40.971 16.971l86.059-86.059c9.373-9.373 9.373-24.569 0-33.941l-86.059-86.059c-15.119-15.119-40.971-4.411-40.971 16.971V216z\"></path></svg>			\n									Learn More\n					</a>\n					<h2>Upcoming Tours & Destination</h2>				\n		<p>Fuerat aestu carentem habentia spectent tonitrua mutastis locavit liberioris. Sinistra possedit litora ut nabataeaque. Setucant coepyterunt perveniunt animal! Concordi aurea nabataeaque seductaque constaque cepit sublime flexi nullus.</p>		\n					<a href=\"#\">\n									Learn More\n					</a>\n															<img width=\"644\" height=\"402\" src=\"http://localhost/abdualziz/wp-content/uploads/2021/02/outdoor-image-01.jpg\" alt=\"\" />															\n															<img width=\"378\" height=\"385\" src=\"http://localhost/abdualziz/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/image-1.jpg\" alt=\"\" />															\n															<img width=\"378\" height=\"385\" src=\"http://localhost/abdualziz/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/snow-1.jpg\" alt=\"\" />															\n															<img width=\"379\" height=\"218\" src=\"http://localhost/abdualziz/wp-content/uploads/2021/02/outdoor-image-04.jpg\" alt=\"\" />															\n		<p>أبجد هوز حطي كلمن سعفص قرشت ثخذ ضظغ</p>', 'الرئيسية', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '540-revision-v1', '', '', '2025-04-17 20:07:44', '2025-04-17 17:07:44', '', 540, 'http://localhost/abdualziz/?p=1280', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
